lics can be found while in battle. The effects of these relics can greatly enhance your deck through powerful interactions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338040/extras/ee056954160302c376e077770cc6775b.avif?t=1714742694\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</h2><br>Cards Survivors offers endless replayability! Test your skills and improve your score!",
